)PANEL KEYLIST(ISRHELP,ISR)
)ATTR DEFAULT(%+_)
/*********************************************************************/
/* PANEL    : MBKPRDH2                                               */
/* TITLE    : HELP - PRODUCT PARAMETER CHANGE SETS (PAGE 2 - FIELDS) */
/*-------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/* KEEP IN STEP WITH PRMNT010 WS-FIELD-VALUES AND MBKPRDCH           */
/* LOAD_FIELD_TABLE.                                                 */
/*-------------------------------------------------------------------*/
/* 2007-02-12 JNB  ORIGINAL                                          */
/* 2008-09-15 JNB  DORMANCY FIELDS                                   */
/*********************************************************************/
  % TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE) SKIP(ON)
  + TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN) SKIP(ON)
  ] TYPE(TEXT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) SKIP(ON)
)BODY EXPAND(//) WIDTH(80)
%TUTORIAL -/-/- CHANGE SET FIELD NAMES -/-/- TUTORIAL
%Command ===>_ZCMD                                                             +
+
+Field names are the PRDPARRC names without%PRD-+.  Enter%FIELDS+on the
+field table for the full list.  Occurrence (Occ) is only keyed for:
+   %CR-TIER-THRESHOLD+and%CR-TIER-RATE+ - tier 1 to 5
+
]Value formats+
+  %Rate  +percent per annum, up to 4 decimals, 0 - 99.9999   e.g.  3.2500
+  %Amount+pounds and pence, up to 2 decimals, no sign         e.g. 1500.00
+  %Number+whole number                                        e.g. 14
+  %Code  +one character from the list shown by FIELDS         e.g. Y
+  %Text  +up to the field length (GL codes upper case)
+
]Common code lists+
+   STATUS A N W     CUST-TYPE P B A     TIER-METHOD W(hole) B(anded)
+   CR-CAP-FREQ M Q H A T     DR-CAP-FREQ M Q     DEFAULT-STMT-CYCLE M Q A
+   indicator fields (...-IND, KYC-REQUIRED) Y N
+
]Fields that are NOT maintained here+
+   Transaction fee table, SWIFT / CHAPS / stopped SO / returned DD fees,
+   card fees, account number range - raise a CR with Core Systems.
+   Statement template - Customer Communications team.
)PROC
  &ZUP = MBKPRDH
)END
